            "count": 1,
            "detail": "`dbt_project.yml` configures how the project is *built*: path lists, profile selection, and per-directory `+materialized`/`+schema` defaults that dbt merges onto nodes at compile time. None of it is dataset structure, and this reader does not merge it onto anything, so the file is carried verbatim in `extras['dbt_project']`.",
